            "body": "@echasnovski What if I were to get the autocommand to run only once using the `once` `opts` flag for `nvim_create_autocmd` for better performance? And as for it not being suitable for `mini.misc` for how short it is, wouldn't the same apply for `setup_restore_cursor()` because it can mostly just be done with `'\"` in normal mode?",
